## Optimization of the nodes: Chebyshev nodes {.smaller}



**Idea:** Take $x_0 < x_1 < \dotsc < x_n$ to be the roots of $T_n$:

$$
x_k=-\cos \Bigl(\pi \frac{k + \frac{1}{2}}{n} \Bigl),
\qquad (0 ≤ k < n)
$$

